      "<b>Fling.</b> The kraken throws a Large or smaller creature Grappled by it to a space it can see within 60 feet of itself that isn&#x27;t in the air. Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 25, the creature thrown and each creature in the destination space. Failure: 18 (4d8) Bludgeoning damage, and the target has the Prone condition. Success: Half damage only.",
